	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: Random Forest was compared with decision tree, elastic net, K-nearest neighbours, LightGBM, logistic regression, multilayer perceptron, radial SVM, and XGBoost. Univariate logistic regression and ten-fold cross-validated LASSO were used to select nine concordant predictors: ECMO type, chronic steroid use, prior lung transplantation, hypertension, allogeneic transfusion, red-blood-cell transfusion, operative time, cold ischemic time, and blood-loss volume. Each algorithm underwent internal five-fold cross-validation for hyperparameter tuning. SHAP plots and Random Forest permutation/Gini importance were used for global and local interpretation.

